/// SMuFL glyph name → codepoint table: every glyph the SMuFL specification
/// names, so any glyph a layout (or an app's override, such as
/// `LayoutSettings.microtonalGlyphs`) asks for can be drawn.
///
/// GENERATED from the specification's glyph list
/// (https://github.com/w3c/smufl, `metadata/glyphnames.json`), ordered by
/// codepoint. Do not edit by hand; regenerate it. A hand-kept subset missed
/// glyphs the engine draws (staccatissimo, the Stein-Zimmermann quarter-tone
/// accidentals), which crashed painting, and had two wrong codepoints.
/// Codepoints are identical in every compliant font, including the bundled
/// Bravura. Pure reference data, shared by the Flutter painter and the SVG
/// emitter.
